  partName: Oil Pan Gasket (7)
  description: The Oil Pan Gasket (7) is a tiny, thin-flat gasket situated at the
    bottom-center-front of the engine, made of Material.001. It seals the oil pan,
    preventing oil leaks and ensuring the engine's lubrication system functions properly.
    Interestingly, its material composition provides excellent resistance to oil
    and heat, making it a reliable sealant.
